1.Customer vanda mathi DASHBOARD vanne ra PARTIES vanne Name rakhdinuss ani Customer, Supplier, Cash in Hand ra Bank Deposit ko table lai vitra halne but nalukne banayara
2.Customer ma click garda vitrako tabale haru Length thick xa sir hight le main senter ko space khayo tyo sabai tabale ko hight lai matra kam gardinuss hai kina ki customer ko list badhi dekhiyoss
3.Amount pani give ra received ma Red ra Green ra settle xa vane defult Color le dekhine banaidinus
4.Add Customer vanne botton senter ma vayo right  side ko xeuma rakhdinuss
5.Test vanne Customer vitra ko table pani hight ma matra sano banaidinuss ani amount haru ma color symbol gardinuss ra statement ko table lai in xa vane halka green le xaya pardinuss ra out xa vane Red le, ra give ra received vanne botton scrool nahune gardinuss
6.Customer add garda name matra halera add garda pani add hune gardinuss
7.customer vitra ko give ra received amount lai Dashboard ko Due amount ra Paid Amount ma dekhine gardinuss